    rulesSub: "食品照射上限、石英管熱衝撃割れ防止、眼球保護遮光基準、作業環境オゾン管理。",
    rule1Title: "1. 米国FDA 21 CFR § 179.41 食品積算照射線量上限（≤ 12.0 J/cm²）",
    rule1Text: "食品表面のパルス光処理において、積算照射線量は12.0 J/cm²以下でなければならないと連邦規則で厳格に定められています。200〜1100 nmの広帯域キセノンランプを用い、パルス幅は2.0 ms以下に制限されます。12.0 J/cm²を超えると油脂酸化や異臭が発生します。",
    rule2Title: "2. 石英管の熱衝撃破損防止と異物混入防止（ΔT < 140°C）",
    rule2Text: "キセノン放電エネルギーの60〜70%は熱として放出されます。強制空冷を行わない場合、石英管表面は260°C〜340°Cに達します。この状態で10°C〜25°Cの洗浄水滴が触れると急激な収縮（ΔT > 140°C）により石英管が粉砕し食品に混入します。NSF/3-A規格の防護網が必須です。",
    rule3Title: "3. 真空紫外（VUV）によるオゾン発生と触媒分解（OSHA PEL ≤ 0.1 ppm）",
    rule3Text: "240 nm以下の波長は大気中の酸素を光分解し高濃度オゾン（15〜45 ppm）を生成します。排気系には二酸化マンガン/酸化銅触媒（Carulite 200）を備え、分解率99.5%以上を維持してOSHA作業環境基準（8時間TWA ≤ 0.1 ppm）を厳守する必要があります。",
    rule4Title: "4. Class 3B/4光放射シールド構造と高圧放電インターロック",
    rule4Text: "メガワット級のマイクロ秒閃光は角膜炎や網膜熱傷を即座に引き起こします。コンベア出入口には光学密度OD ≥ 8の迷路遮光構造を設置し、パネル開放時にはNFPA 79に基づき2秒以内にコンデンサ電圧を安全レベルまで強制放電する機構が義務付けられています。",
    copyReportBtn: "診断レポートをコピー",
    copiedFeedback: "レポートをクリップボードにコピーしました！"
  }
};

const d = DICTIONARY[lang] || DICTIONARY.en;
---

<div class="hipl-modeler-container my-8">
  <!-- Controls Panel -->
  <div class="p-6 bg-surface-soft rounded-2xl border border-hairline shadow-xs mb-8">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-amber-600 text-white">
        {d.badge}
      </span>
      <span class="text-xs text-muted font-mono">FDA 21 CFR § 179.41 &bull; OSHA 1910 &bull; NFPA 79</span>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-1">
      {d.controlsTitle}
    </h2>
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted mb-6 leading-relaxed">
      {d.controlsSub}
    </p>

    <!-- Presets Bar -->
    <div class="mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-hairline">
      <span class="block text-xs font-bold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
        {d.presetsTitle}
      </span>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <button id="preset-egg" type="button" class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-surface hover:bg-amber-500/10 hover:text-amber-600 border border-hairline text-ink transition-colors">
          {d.presetEgg}
        </button>
        <button id="preset-bottle" type="button" class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-surface hover:bg-amber-500/10 hover:text-amber-600 border border-hairline text-ink transition-colors">
          {d.presetBottle}
        </button>
        <button id="preset-belt" type="button" class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-surface hover:bg-amber-500/10 hover:text-amber-600 border border-hairline text-ink transition-colors">
          {d.presetBelt}
        </button>
        <button id="preset-catastrophic" type="button" class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-surface hover:bg-rose-500/10 hover:text-rose-600 border border-hairline text-ink transition-colors">
          {d.presetCatastrophic}
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Selectors Row -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-6">
      <!-- Select System Architecture -->
      <div>
        <label for="machine-select" class="block text-xs font-bold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">
          {d.machineLabel}
        </label>
        <select id="machine-select" class="w-full text-xs sm:text-sm p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-soft border border-hairline text-ink focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500">
          {hiplData.hiplSystems.map(m => (
            <option value={m.id} selected={m.id === 'commercial_industrial_hipl'}>{m.name}</option>
          ))}
        </select>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1 leading-snug">{d.machineHelp}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Select Target Pathogen -->
      <div>
        <label for="pathogen-select" class="block text-xs font-bold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">
          {d.pathogenLabel}
        </label>
        <select id="pathogen-select" class="w-full text-xs sm:text-sm p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-soft border border-hairline text-ink focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500">
          {hiplData.targetPathogens.map(p => (
            <option value={p.id} selected={p.id === 'salmonella_enterica'}>{p.name}</option>
          ))}
        </select>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1 leading-snug">{d.pathogenHelp}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Select Quartz Sleeve Material -->
      <div>
        <label for="quartz-select" class="block text-xs font-bold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">
          {d.quartzLabel}
        </label>
        <select id="quartz-select" class="w-full text-xs sm:text-sm p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-soft border border-hairline text-ink focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500">
          {hiplData.quartzSleeveProfiles.map(q => (
            <option value={q.id} selected={q.id === 'synthetic_fused_silica'}>{q.name}</option>
          ))}
        </select>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1 leading-snug">{d.quartzHelp}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Select Ozone Catalyst Unit -->
      <div>
        <label for="catalyst-select" class="block text-xs font-bold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">
          {d.catalystLabel}
        </label>
        <select id="catalyst-select" class="w-full text-xs sm:text-sm p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-soft border border-hairline text-ink focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500">
          {hiplData.ozoneCatalystProfiles.map(c => (
            <option value={c.id} selected={c.id === 'carulite_mno2_cuo'}>{c.name}</option>
          ))}
        </select>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1 leading-snug">{d.catalystHelp}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sliders Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-6">
      <!-- Discharge Voltage Slider -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
          <label for="voltage-range" class="text-xs font-bold text-ink">{d.voltageLabel}</label>
          <span id="voltage-val" class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">2,800 V</span>
        </div>
        <input id="voltage-range" type="range" min="1500" max="3800" step="50" value="2800" class="w-full accent-amber-600" />
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-0.5">{d.voltageHelp}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pulse Repetition Rate Slider -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
          <label for="rate-range" class="text-xs font-bold text-ink">{d.repRateLabel}</label>
          <span id="rate-val" class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">12 Hz</span>
        </div>
        <input id="rate-range" type="range" min="1" max="20" step="1" value="12" class="w-full accent-amber-600" />
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-0.5">{d.repRateHelp}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Residence Time Slider -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
          <label for="residence-range" class="text-xs font-bold text-ink">{d.residenceLabel}</label>
          <span id="residence-val" class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">6.0 s</span>
        </div>
        <input id="residence-range" type="range" min="2" max="30" step="0.5" value="6.0" class="w-full accent-amber-600" />
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-0.5">{d.residenceHelp}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Lamp Distance Slider -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
          <label for="distance-range" class="text-xs font-bold text-ink">{d.distanceLabel}</label>
          <span id="distance-val" class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">45 mm</span>
        </div>
        <input id="distance-range" type="range" min="20" max="120" step="5" value="45" class="w-full accent-amber-600" />
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-0.5">{d.distanceHelp}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- CIP Washdown Splash Temp Slider -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
          <label for="splash-range" class="text-xs font-bold text-ink">{d.splashTempLabel}</label>
          <span id="splash-val" class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">18 °C</span>
        </div>
        <input id="splash-range" type="range" min="10" max="45" step="1" value="18" class="w-full accent-amber-600" />
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-0.5">{d.splashTempHelp}</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Exhaust Ozone Ventilation Airflow Slider -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
          <label for="airflow-range" class="text-xs font-bold text-ink">{d.airFlowLabel}</label>
          <span id="airflow-val" class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">320 CFM</span>
        </div>
        <input id="airflow-range" type="range" min="50" max="600" step="10" value="320" class="w-full accent-amber-600" />
        <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-0.5">{d.airFlowHelp}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Toggles Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-4 border-t border-hairline">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <input id="cooling-toggle" type="checkbox" checked class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 rounded border-hairline text-amber-600 focus:ring-amber-500 accent-amber-600" />
        <div>
          <label for="cooling-toggle" class="text-xs font-bold text-ink block cursor-pointer">
            {d.coolingToggleLabel}
          </label>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted leading-relaxed">{d.coolingToggleHelp}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <input id="interlock-toggle" type="checkbox" checked class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 rounded border-hairline text-amber-600 focus:ring-amber-500 accent-amber-600" />
        <div>
          <label for="interlock-toggle" class="text-xs font-bold text-ink block cursor-pointer">
            {d.interlockToggleLabel}
          </label>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted leading-relaxed">{d.interlockToggleHelp}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Telemetry & Diagnostic Dashboards -->
  <div class="mb-8 p-6 bg-surface rounded-xl border border-hairline">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between sm:items-center gap-3 mb-6">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-1">{d.diagnosticTitle}</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted">{d.diagnosticSub}</p>
      </div>
      <button id="copy-report-btn" type="button" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white transition-colors self-start sm:self-auto">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
          <path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path>
        </svg>
        <span id="copy-btn-text">{d.copyReportBtn}</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- Status Banner -->
    <div id="safety-banner" class="mb-6 p-4 rounded-xl border flex items-start gap-3 bg-emerald-500/10 border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300">
      <span class="text-xl">✅</span>
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">{d.safetyStatusLabel}</div>
        <div id="safety-status-text" class="text-sm font-extrabold mt-0.5">OPTIMAL - FDA 21 CFR § 179.41 &amp; OSHA 1910 COMPLIANT</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Telemetry Cards Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-6">
      <div class="p-3.5 bg-surface-soft rounded-lg border border-hairline">
        <div class="text-[11px] text-muted font-medium mb-1">{d.pulseEnergyLabel}</div>
        <div id="telemetry-energy" class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold text-ink">470.4 J</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-0.5">E = 0.5 &bull; C &bull; V&sup2;</div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-3.5 bg-surface-soft rounded-lg border border-hairline">
        <div class="text-[11px] text-muted font-medium mb-1">{d.peakPowerLabel}</div>
        <div id="telemetry-power" class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">1.68 MW</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-0.5">&tau; = 280 &mu;s Flash</div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-3.5 bg-surface-soft rounded-lg border border-hairline">
        <div class="text-[11px] text-muted font-medium mb-1">{d.cumulativeFluenceLabel}</div>
        <div id="telemetry-fluence" class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold text-ink">3.12 J/cm&sup2;</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-0.5">FDA Limit: &le; 12.0 J/cm&sup2;</div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-3.5 bg-surface-soft rounded-lg border border-hairline">
        <div class="text-[11px] text-muted font-medium mb-1">{d.logReductionLabel}</div>
        <div id="telemetry-reduction" class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">&gt; 5.4-Log</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-0.5">Target: &ge; 5.0-Log</div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-3.5 bg-surface-soft rounded-lg border border-hairline">
        <div class="text-[11px] text-muted font-medium mb-1">{d.quartzTempLabel}</div>
        <div id="telemetry-temp" class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold text-ink">112 °C</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-0.5">Ceiling: &le; 280 °C</div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-3.5 bg-surface-soft rounded-lg border border-hairline">
        <div class="text-[11px] text-muted font-medium mb-1">{d.shockMarginLabel}</div>
        <div id="telemetry-shock" class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">+66 °C Margin</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-0.5">&Delta;T = 94°C vs 160°C Limit</div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-3.5 bg-surface-soft rounded-lg border border-hairline">
        <div class="text-[11px] text-muted font-medium mb-1">{d.exhaustOzoneLabel}</div>
        <div id="telemetry-ozone" class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">0.018 ppm</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-0.5">OSHA PEL: &le; 0.10 ppm</div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-3.5 bg-surface-soft rounded-lg border border-hairline">
        <div class="text-[11px] text-muted font-medium mb-1">{d.opticalShieldLabel}</div>
        <div id="telemetry-shield" class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">OD 8.4 (Safe)</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-muted mt-0.5">OSHA Eye Hazard: Nil</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Diagnostic Narrative Box -->
    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-surface-soft border border-hairline text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-2.5">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline gap-1">
        <span class="font-bold text-ink min-w-[200px]">{d.primaryRiskLabel}</span>
        <span id="narrative-risk" class="text-muted">None. Continuous flash operations maintain safe radiant fluence and thermal shock safety margin.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline gap-1">
        <span class="font-bold text-ink min-w-[200px]">{d.mechanismsLabel}</span>
        <span id="narrative-mech" class="text-muted">High-energy microsecond xenon arc discharges emit lethal 200-280 nm germicidal UV-C. Photochemical pyrimidine photolysis forms thymine-thymine dimers in bacterial DNA, halting transcription without bulk thermal degradation of food matrices.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline gap-1">
        <span class="font-bold text-ink min-w-[200px]">{d.mitigationLabel}</span>
        <span id="narrative-mitigation" class="text-muted">Maintain high-velocity vortex cooling air across quartz sleeves, verify Carulite catalytic honeycomb destruct activity, and audit optical labyrinth light traps.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Real-Time Interactive Machine Diagram (SVG) -->
  <div class="mb-8 p-6 bg-surface rounded-xl border border-hairline">
    <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 flex items-center justify-between">
      <span>Continuous HIPL Decontamination Tunnel Diagram</span>
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-600">Cross-Sectional Vector Physics</span>
    </h3>

    <div class="w-full overflow-x-auto">
      <svg class="w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto h-auto min-w-[580px]" viewBox="0 0 760 320" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <rect width="760" height="320" rx="12" fill="#0f172a" />
        
        <!-- Tunnel Enclosure -->
        <rect x="60" y="40" width="640" height="240" rx="8" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#334155" stroke-width="2" />
        <rect x="65" y="45" width="630" height="230" rx="6" fill="#0f172a" />

        <!-- Optical Infeed and Outfeed Labyrinth Baffles -->
        <path d="M 60 140 L 140 140 L 140 190 L 160 190" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
        <path d="M 60 210 L 120 210 L 120 160 L 160 160" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
        <text x="70" y="130" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="10" font-family="monospace">Infeed Light Trap</text>

        <path d="M 600 160 L 640 160 L 640 210 L 700 210" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
        <path d="M 600 190 L 620 190 L 620 140 L 700 140" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
        <text x="610" y="130" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="10" font-family="monospace">Exit Light Trap</text>

        <!-- Conveyor Belt -->
        <line x1="100" y1="230" x2="660" y2="230" stroke="#475569" stroke-width="6" />
        <circle cx="120" cy="230" r="14" fill="#334155" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2" />
        <circle cx="640" cy="230" r="14" fill="#334155" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2" />
        <text x="330" y="255" fill="#64748b" font-size="11" font-family="sans-serif">Continuous Food Contact Conveyor Belt</text>

        <!-- Food Items on Conveyor -->
        <ellipse cx="220" cy="216" rx="16" ry="12" fill="#fde047" stroke="#ca8a04" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <ellipse cx="320" cy="216" rx="16" ry="12" fill="#fde047" stroke="#ca8a04" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <ellipse cx="420" cy="216" rx="16" ry="12" fill="#fde047" stroke="#ca8a04" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <ellipse cx="520" cy="216" rx="16" ry="12" fill="#fde047" stroke="#ca8a04" stroke-width="1.5" />

        <!-- Parabolic Reflector Hood -->
        <path d="M 240 85 Q 380 50 520 85 L 530 115 Q 380 90 230 115 Z" fill="#334155" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="325" y="72" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="10" font-family="sans-serif">Parabolic Specular Reflector</text>

        <!-- Quartz Sleeve Envelope -->
        <rect id="svg-quartz" x="250" y="105" width="260" height="28" rx="14" fill="rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15)" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="2" />
        <text x="320" y="123" fill="#38bdf8" font-size="10" font-family="monospace">Synthetic Fused Quartz Sleeve</text>

        <!-- Xenon Flash Lamp Arc (Center) -->
        <line id="svg-arc" x1="265" y1="119" x2="495" y2="119" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <line x1="265" y1="119" x2="495" y2="119" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />

        <!-- Pulsed UV Rays Downward -->
        <g id="svg-rays" opacity="0.8">
          <line x1="270" y1="135" x2="220" y2="204" stroke="#fbbf24" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />
          <line x1="310" y1="135" x2="290" y2="204" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />
          <line x1="350" y1="135" x2="330" y2="204" stroke="#e0e7ff" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />
          <line x1="380" y1="135" x2="380" y2="204" stroke="#a5b4fc" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />
          <line x1="410" y1="135" x2="430" y2="204" stroke="#fbbf24" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />
          <line x1="450" y1="135" x2="480" y2="204" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />
          <line x1="490" y1="135" x2="530" y2="204" stroke="#e0e7ff" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />
        </g>

        <!-- Vortex Cooling Jet Arrows -->
        <path d="M 220 119 L 245 119" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />
        <path d="M 540 119 L 515 119" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />
        <text x="175" y="112" fill="#38bdf8" font-size="9" font-family="monospace">Cooling Air Jet</text>

        <!-- Exhaust Ozone Duct & Catalyst Unit -->
        <rect x="340" y="10" width="80" height="30" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <line x1="340" y1="25" x2="420" y2="25" stroke="#f43f5e" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="2 2" />
        <text x="352" y="28" fill="#fda4af" font-size="9" font-family="sans-serif">MnO2 Catalyst</text>
        <path d="M 380 40 L 380 20" stroke="#f43f5e" stroke-width="2" />
        <text x="430" y="24" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="9" font-family="sans-serif">Ozone Free Exhaust &rarr;</text>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Deep Scientific Technical Specifications -->
  <div class="mb-8 p-6 bg-surface-soft rounded-2xl border border-hairline">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-1">{d.scienceTitle}</h3>
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted mb-6">{d.scienceSub}</p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-ink text-sm">1. Broad-Spectrum Photochemical Photolysis &amp; DNA Dimerization</h4>
        <p>
          High-Intensity Pulsed Light (HIPL) utilizes high-energy xenon flashlamps producing microsecond pulses (100–450 μs) of rich polychromatic light spanning 200 nm to 1,100 nm (~54% germicidal UV, 26% visible, 20% near-infrared). Electrical energy stored in capacitor banks is discharged instantaneously:
        </p>
        <div class="p-2.5 bg-surface rounded-lg font-mono text-xs text-ink border border-hairline">
          E_stored = 0.5 &bull; C &bull; V&sup2; [Joules]<br/>
          P_peak = E_discharge / &tau;_pulse &approx; 1.0 to 6.5 Megawatts
        </div>
        <p>
          The germicidal UV-C portion (200–280 nm, peak absorption at 254–260 nm) photochemically ruptures phosphodiester and nucleotide bonds in bacterial and fungal DNA, generating cyclobutane pyrimidine dimers (CPDs, primarily thymine-thymine dimers) and 6-4 photoproducts. These covalent lesions arrest DNA transcription and replication, overwhelming bacterial SOS repair pathways.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-ink text-sm">2. Non-Thermal Photophysical Rupture &amp; Spore Inactivation</h4>
        <p>
          Unlike steady-state low-pressure UV lamps (continuous monochromatic 254 nm), HIPL concentrates enormous optical power into microsecond bursts. The sheer rate of photon absorption induces rapid, localized thermal expansion gradients across microbial cell walls:
        </p>
        <div class="p-2.5 bg-surface rounded-lg font-mono text-xs text-ink border border-hairline">
          Log(N0 / N) = &Phi; / D_value &bull; [1 - e^(-k &bull; &Phi;)]<br/>
          Target: &ge; 5.0-Log Reduction (Salmonella &amp; Listeria)
        </div>
        <p>
          For fungal conidia (such as <em>Aspergillus niger</em>) and bacterial endospores (<em>Bacillus subtilis</em>), protective melanized coats and dipicolinic acid/SASP complexes absorb UV. Microsecond pulse spikes photothermally rupture spore crusts and membrane envelopes, achieving inactivation at radiant fluences far below those required by steady-state mercury lamps.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-ink text-sm">3. Quartz Sleeve Thermal Mechanics &amp; Thermal Shock Fracture (&Delta;T)</h4>
        <p>
          Approximately 60% of lamp discharge energy converts into conductive and radiant thermal dissipation within the synthetic fused silica quartz protection sleeve. In the absence of convective vortex air cooling, quartz envelope surface temperatures escalate to 240°C–320°C:
        </p>
        <div class="p-2.5 bg-surface rounded-lg font-mono text-xs text-ink border border-hairline">
          &Delta;T_shock = T_quartz - T_splash [&deg;C]<br/>
          Failure: &Delta;T_shock &gt; &Delta;T_tolerance (160&deg;C for Suprasil, 65&deg;C for Solarized)
        </div>
        <p>
          Cold CIP sanitation water splashes (10°C–25°C) or overhead condensate drips onto unchilled quartz generate steep biaxial tensile hoop stresses. When the thermal shock differential exceeds the fracture threshold, brittle tensile failure catastrophically shatters the tube, sending quartz fragments onto food conveyors.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-ink text-sm">4. Vacuum UV Ozone Generation &amp; Catalytic Decomposition</h4>
        <p>
          Radiation emitted below 240 nm (specifically the 185 nm vacuum UV line) photolyzes ambient diatomic oxygen into excited oxygen radicals, rapidly forming toxic ozone (O3):
        </p>
        <div class="p-2.5 bg-surface rounded-lg font-mono text-xs text-ink border border-hairline">
          O2 + h&nu; (&lt;240nm) &rarr; 2 O(&bull;); O(&bull;) + O2 &rarr; O3 [15-45 ppm in chamber]<br/>
          2 O3 --[MnO2 / CuO Catalyst]&rarr; 3 O2 (&ge; 99.5% efficiency, &le; 0.05 ppm)
        </div>
        <p>
          Exhaust blowers must draw chamber air across Carulite 200 manganese dioxide/copper oxide catalytic beds to dismantle O3 into stable O2 prior to building discharge, guaranteeing compliance with the OSHA Permissible Exposure Limit (PEL ≤ 0.10 ppm 8-hour TWA).
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

